Package: vexos-devstudio
Version: 1.0-1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nour-yahyaoui <https://github.com/Nour-yahyaoui>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9)
Recommends: gcc, g++, make, gdb, nodejs, npm, rustc, cargo, git, xdg-utils
Description: VexOS DevStudio, a web IDE for C, Python, Node.js, and Rust
 A browser-based development environment that runs on this computer.
 Edit code with syntax colors, run C, C++, Python, JavaScript, Rust and
 shell scripts, create React, Next.js, and Rust projects, and preview web
 apps. An AI assistant uses the Groq API when you add your key in Settings.
